      "simplified": "“如果房子里有个女人，会怎么样？”",
      "traditional": "“如果房子裡有個女人，會怎麼樣？”",
      "pinyin": "rú guǒ fáng zi lǐ yǒu ge nǚ rén huì zěn me yàng",
      "english": "Next, she wrote the character for “woman” underneath it, and asked everyone, .."
