      "pinyin": "zhōng guó rén rèn wéi rú guǒ fáng zi lǐ yǒu ge nǚ rén zhè jiù dài biǎo zhe píng ān",
      "english": "All of the students laughed. The teacher laughed too, and said, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "所以汉字‘安’就是上面一个‘宀’（宝盖头），下面一个‘女’。”",
      "traditional": "所以漢字‘安’就是上面一個‘宀’（寶蓋頭），下面一個‘女’。”",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ hàn zì ān jiù shì shàng miàn yí ge bǎo gài tóu xià miàn yí ge nǚ",
      "english": ".. “Chinese people believe that if there is a woman inside a house, this means safe and sound."
