    "sentence_translations": [
      "The meaning of “safe”",
      "",
      "In Chinese character class, the teacher wrote ”roof” (roof radical) on the blackboard, ..",
      ".. and moreover told everyone that in Chinese characters, this radical has the meaning of ”house”.",
      "Next, she wrote the character for “woman” underneath it, and asked everyone, ..",
      ".. “If there is a woman inside a house, what will it be like?”",
      "",
      "A student answered, “Very troublesome!”",
      "",
      "All of the students laughed. The teacher laughed too, and said, ..",
      ".. “Chinese people believe that if there is a woman inside a house, this means safe and sound.",
      "Therefore, the Chinese character for “safe” is a “roof” (roof radical) on top and a “woman” below."
    ]
  }
